  "details": "I think having the ability to add extra Labels for extra emotes on the Two/Four Axis puppet would be beneficial.\nYou can add emotes to it but without knowing what they are, it gets a bit tedious remembering what they are when you need them in a flash.\nI already barely remember my Gestures.\nAnd also the ability to use Layers with the Two/Four Axis Puppet would be appreciated, for some reason the game blends the previous Layer Emotes when you attempt to use the other layer.\nOr even just having the option to add more Emotes to 1 control for the other setups like Button/Toggle rather than having to make new controls.",
